{"3593740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mist Island Survival", "steam_appid": 3593740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mist Island Survival is a 2D pixel-art survival action RPG. You wake up on a fog-shrouded island blanketed by dense jungles. Amid the wildlands with alternating day and night cycles, gather resources, craft gear, and master skills as you face off against ferocious monsters once night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may venture deep into the misty jungles to push the limits of your survival, or descend layer by layer into perilous dungeons to hunt rare loot and battle deadlier foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends diverse gameplay loops: wilderness survival, dungeon crawling, equipment forging, and character skill progression. Spend your daylight hours chopping trees and mining ore, then defend yourself through the foggy nights. Access your storage vault and blacksmith workshop right from the main menu, where you forge powerful unique weapons and armor with random affixes with your own hands. Every expedition earns you experience, steadily strengthening your character to endure the deadly mist.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mist Island Survival is a 2D pixel-art survival action RPG. You wake up on a fog-shrouded island blanketed by dense jungles. Amid the wildlands with alternating day and night cycles, gather resources, craft gear, and master skills as you face off against ferocious monsters once night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may venture deep into the misty jungles to push the limits of your survival, or descend layer by layer into perilous dungeons to hunt rare loot and battle deadlier foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends diverse gameplay loops: wilderness survival, dungeon crawling, equipment forging, and character skill progression. Spend your daylight hours chopping trees and mining ore, th